Description: An 'SCSS' compiler, powered by the 'LibSass' library. With
    this, R developers can use variables, inheritance, and functions to
    generate dynamic style sheets. The package uses the 'Sass CSS'
    extension language, which is stable, powerful, and CSS compatible.
